# Data, runs and outputs are never committed (tests/test_committed_files.py).
# Input data is often licensed or confidential; see docs/guides/data-sources.md.
/input
/output
*.nc
# The small synthetic example examples/run_minimal.py reads.
!examples/data/era5/era5_example.nc
*.png
# The figures docs/guides/visualisation.md shows.
!docs/img/*.png
# The licensed curve library is never redistributed. /input already covers
# these; they stay explicit so the rule survives if /input is ever narrowed.
# See input/README.md.
input/reference/power_curves.real.csv
input/reference/models.real.csv

